00:02:04.385 --> 00:02:07.451
(audience applause)

00:02:07.451 --> 00:02:11.000
- It's our big fundraiser this year.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.833
Well, every year.

00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:16.833
It's the main thing we do
for the True Colors United.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.213
It's an organization that we did to,

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.273
to help eradicate, I guess,

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.730
youth homelessness

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:31.730
and that ranges anywhere from 12 to 24.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:34.890
And what we discovered

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:39.890
was that there's 3.7 million
kids on the street in one year

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:44.460
and up to 40% of them are LGBTQ,

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.470
which is a lesbian or gay.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.870
And you start to realize
that a lot of these kids

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.610
are getting thrown out of their homes

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:53.660
as they come out to their parents.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.970
I'm a mom.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:56.560
You never get the kid,

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:59.130
the kid isn't who you want the kid to be,

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.124
the kid is who the kid is and as a mom...

00:03:02.124 --> 00:03:04.469
(audience applause)

00:03:04.469 --> 00:03:07.583
You know, you don't want
to throw your kid out.

00:03:07.583 --> 00:03:10.350
- It's great you do that
work and I think it's so,

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:12.621
