00:03:12.621 --> 00:03:15.670
and it is, but it's not better everywhere,

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.327
and it's not better in every household.

00:03:17.327 --> 00:03:19.010
- It's not better, it's not better

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:19.843
