00:03:19.843 --> 00:03:22.080
that's way down here then
you've still only made it here.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.430
- That's right.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.263
- You've got a long way to go.
- Yeah.

00:03:24.263 --> 00:03:26.300
- But guys, it's not.
- Yeah.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:30.790
- I mean, we've been trying,
but it's still up to 40%.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:31.623
- Yeah.

00:03:31.623 --> 00:03:35.140
- I just think that we can
do stuff with education

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.640
