00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.590
This is the work we do.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.550
We lobby.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:49.550
We've had people from
like 50 Cent to Laurie...

00:03:50.638 --> 00:03:51.918
- I think Pink has done...
- Pink.

00:03:51.918 --> 00:03:52.751
- Pink, yeah.

00:03:52.751 --> 00:03:53.610
- Reverend Cox.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.300
