00:04:12.137 --> 00:04:13.835
That's the key.

00:04:13.835 --> 00:04:16.420
- Well, we can grow.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.825
- You took your platform
though and you did something.

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:19.837
That's a cool thing.

00:04:19.837 --> 00:04:23.970
- You know, you can't
throw away our youth.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.640
Our youth is our future.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.561
